  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "currentBehavior": [
    "Connector reporting is based on Dashboard-accepted synchronization time, not manager observation time.",
    "Reporting loss emits connector-offline and suppresses profile diagnoses; retained manager and workload evidence does not become current or prove recovery.",
    "Fresh connector contact does not refresh an older manager source-observed timestamp.",
    "Current incident identity preserves one stable candidate key per persistent condition episode; no multi-condition grouping is applied.",
    "Incident pages expose visible records and truncation but do not expose an authoritative total.",
    "Completed support results remain stored and an exact tenant-scoped session read returns the same verified result after navigation."
